{"id":"700b210d964b7299","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-tm-output.md","title":"Two-Way Machine Output","display":"df-tm-output — Two-Way Machine Output","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-tm-output","aliases":["90-df-tm-output"],"display":"df-tm-output — Two-Way Machine Output","depends_on":["[[90-df-tm-halts]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-tm-output"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-tm-output</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tm-output — Two-Way Machine Output"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ffc504ac94bd0528\" href=\"?note=ffc504ac94bd0528\" title=\"90-df-tm-halts\">90-df-tm-halts</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\">\\(\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M\\)</span>。停机后输出为从格 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 开始直到第一个空白之前的有限词；负位置和第一个空白之后的内容不属于输出。</li>\n<li>输出函数只在停机输入上定义；有限支持保证下式的第一个空白位置存在。接受、拒绝停机采用同一输出提取约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell_M(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\tau(n)=B_M\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau\\upharpoonright\\ell_M(\\tau),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)&amp;\\in(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Output}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(w,z)\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\exists(q,\\tau,h)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\\n[\\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,(q,\\tau,h))\\land z=\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Output}_M&amp;:\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Output}_M)&amp;=\\{w\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell_M(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\tau(n)=B_M\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau\\upharpoonright\\ell_M(\\tau),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)&amp;\\in(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Output}_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(w,z)\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\times(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{&lt;\\omega}:\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{5em}\\exists(q,\\tau,h)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\\n[\\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,(q,\\tau,h))\\land z=\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Output}_M&amp;:\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Output}_M)&amp;=\\{w\\in\\Sigma_M^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 此输出是词，不是原 90 计算历史的数值提取 U(y)。所选输出约定与有限输入输出表示一同固定，不能在调用 Effective 时临时更换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"ffc504ac94bd0528","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma_M^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\operatorname{Tape}^{88}_M","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\ell_M(\\tau)&\\coloneqq\\min\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:\\tau(n)=B_M\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)&\\coloneqq\\tau\\upharpoonright\\ell_M(\\tau),\\\\\n\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)&\\in(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{<\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Output}_M&\\coloneqq\\{(w,z)\\in\\Sigma_M^{<\\omega}\\times(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{<\\omega}:\\\\\n&\\hspace{5em}\\exists(q,\\tau,h)\\in\\operatorname{Conf}^{88}_M\\\n[\\operatorname{HaltConf}^{88}_M(w,(q,\\tau,h))\\land z=\\operatorname{TapeOut}^{88}_M(\\tau)]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Output}_M&:\\Sigma_M^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup(\\Gamma_M\\setminus\\{B_M\\})^{<\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\operatorname{Output}_M)&=\\{w\\in\\Sigma_M^{<\\omega}:\\operatorname{Halts}_M(w)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1729,"backlinks":[{"id":"5f0d45b79409d64f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4de0ebda11529dc6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM},\\Sigma_M,\\operatorname{Halts}_M,\\operatorname{Output}_M$ 分别见 [[90-df-turing-machine]]、[[90-df-tm-halts]]、[[90-df-tm-output]]。"},{"id":"10ddd9c20c6edffd","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-tm-output]]"},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"| `wordenc`、`worddec` | 带元数前缀的数值元组词编码及像集上的部分逆；空元组的词码是单个位0。 | [[90-df-encoding]] |\n| `AcceptNum`、`EffNum`、`s_{m,n}` | 有效通用求值、覆盖及全递归翻译；s-m-n保留程序索引在先的顺序。 | [[90-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]、[[90-thm-smn]] |\n| `Halts_M`、`Output_M`、`Comp_k^{88}` | 本地通用双向纸带的停机、词输出及数值可计算性；不等同于半无限纸带历史码。 | [[90-df-tm-halts]]、[[90-df-tm-output]]、[[90-df-computable-function]] |